{\rtf1\ansi\deff0{\fonttbl{\f0 Calibri;}{\f1 Segoe UI;}}{\colortbl;\red33\green37\blue41;\red13\green71\blue161;\red0\green120\blue212;\red110\green118\blue129;\red235\green240\blue248;}\paperw11907\paperh16840\margl1000\margr1000\margt900\margb900\viewkind4\uc1\n\pard\sa240\qc\b\fs44\cf2 GitHub + Blogger Dagitim Rehberi\par\n\pard\sa220\qc\i\fs22\cf4 Uygulama dosyalarini (APK/EXE) guvenli, ucretsiz ve surumlu sekilde paylasma plani\par\n\pard\sa90\fs20\cf4 Guncelleme Tarihi: 30.03.2026 15:53\par\n\pard\brdrb\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf5\sa120\par\n\pard\sa180\sb220\b\fs30\cf2 Hizli Ozet\par\n\pard\sa110\sb80\li220\ri220\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf3\shading120\cbpat5\fs22\cf1 Ana dagitim noktasi GitHub Releases, yedek nokta Google Drive olacak sekilde planlandi. 50 MB - 300 MB arasi dosyalar bu model icin uygundur.\par\n\pard\sa120\sb140\b\fs24\cf3 Kritik limitler:\par\n\pard\sa80\li520\fi-260\fs22\cf1\bullet\tab Release basina en fazla 1000 asset (dosya).\par\n\pard\sa80\li520\fi-260\fs22\cf1\bullet\tab Her bir asset dosyasi en fazla 2 GiB.\par\n\pard\sa80\li520\fi-260\fs22\cf1\bullet\tab Toplam release boyutu icin sabit bir ust limit belirtilmiyor.\par\n\pard\sa180\sb220\b\fs30\cf2 1000 Asset Ne Demek?\par\n\pard\sa110\fs22\cf1 Asset, bir release icine yuklenen her bir dosyadir (APK, EXE, ZIP, SHA256 vb.).\par\n\pard\sa120\sb140\b\fs24\cf3 Ornek kapasite hesaplari:\par\n\pard\sa80\li520\fi-260\fs22\cf1\bullet\tab Uygulama basina 1 dosya: 1000 uygulama/release\par\n\pard\sa80\li520\fi-260\fs22\cf1\bullet\tab Uygulama basina 2 dosya (APK+EXE): 500 uygulama/release\par\n\pard\sa80\li520\fi-260\fs22\cf1\bullet\tab Uygulama basina 3 dosya (APK+EXE+tek checksum): 333 uygulama/release\par\n\pard\sa80\li520\fi-260\fs22\cf1\bullet\tab Uygulama basina 4 dosya (APK+EXE+2 checksum): 250 uygulama/release\par\n\pard\sa180\sb220\b\fs30\cf2 Blogger Icin Onerilen Yapi\par\n\pard\sa120\sb140\b\fs24\cf3 Her surumde iki indirme butonu kullanin:\par\n\pard\sa80\li520\fi-260\fs22\cf1\bullet\tab Indir (GitHub) - birincil link\par\n\pard\sa80\li520\fi-260\fs22\cf1\bullet\tab Yedek Indir (Drive) - yedek link\par\n\pard\sa90\fs20\cf4 Not: Google Drive 100 MB ustu dosyalarda vir?s tarama siniri nedeniyle uyari gosterebilir.\par\n\pard\sa180\sb220\b\fs30\cf2 Guncelleme Otomasyonu (Onerilen)\par\n\pard\sa120\sb140\b\fs24\cf3 Tag bazli release akisina gecin (ornek: v1.2.3):\par\n\pard\sa80\li520\fi-260\fs22\cf1\bullet\tab Tag push -> GitHub Actions build (APK/EXE)\par\n\pard\sa80\li520\fi-260\fs22\cf1\bullet\tab Checksum uretimi (.sha256)\par\n\pard\sa80\li520\fi-260\fs22\cf1\bullet\tab Release olusturma ve asset yukleme\par\n\pard\sa80\li520\fi-260\fs22\cf1\bullet\tab Blogger sabit latest linkler ile otomatik en guncel dosyaya yonlendirme\par\n\pard\sa90\fs20\cf4 Kullanici indirmesi icin Actions artifact degil, Release asset linkleri kullanilmali.\par\n\pard\sa180\sb220\b\fs30\cf2 Blogger Icin Pratik Link Formati\par\n\pard\sa110\fs22\cf1 https://github.com/<owner>/<repo>/releases/latest/download/app.apk\par\n\pard\sa110\fs22\cf1 https://github.com/<owner>/<repo>/releases/latest/download/app.exe\par\n\pard\sa90\fs20\cf4 Bu formatla Blogger tarafinda butonlari degistirmeden en guncel surume gecis yapilabilir.\par\n\pard\sa180\sb220\b\fs30\cf2 Guven ve Destek Tavsiyeleri\par\n\pard\sa80\li520\fi-260\fs22\cf1\bullet\tab Her dosya yanina SHA256 checksum yayinlayin.\par\n\pard\sa80\li520\fi-260\fs22\cf1\bullet\tab Surum notuna degisiklik ozetini kisa ve net yazin.\par\n\pard\sa80\li520\fi-260\fs22\cf1\bullet\tab Sorun yasayan kullanici icin yedek link ve onceki surum linki bulundurun.\par\n\pard\sa180\sb220\b\fs30\cf2 Kaynaklar\par\n\pard\sa110\fs22\cf1 GitHub Releases: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/releasing-projects-on-github/about-releases\par\n\pard\sa110\fs22\cf1 GitHub Linking to Releases: https://docs.github.com/en/repositories/releasing-projects-on-github/linking-to-releases\par\n\pard\sa110\fs22\cf1 GitHub Releases API: https://docs.github.com/en/rest/releases/releases\par\n\pard\sa110\fs22\cf1 GitHub Workflow Artifacts: https://docs.github.com/en/actions/concepts/workflows-and-actions/workflow-artifacts\par\n\pard\sa110\fs22\cf1 Google Drive Size Limits: https://support.google.com/drive/answer/37603\par\n\pard\sa110\fs22\cf1 Google Drive 100 MB virus scan note: https://support.google.com/drive/answer/141702\par\n\pard\brdrb\brdrs\brdrw20\brdrcf5\sa120\par\n\pard\sa90\fs20\cf4 Not: Bu dokuman repo icinde bilgi referansi icin uretildi.\par\n}